trial and consumer goods in India and internationally. The company operates through two segments: Manufacturing Business and Ecosystem Business. The company's Manufacturing Business segment designs, manufactures, supplies, and installs products across energy, precision, and capital goods verticals. Under energy products, it offers fabricated steel structures, solar modules, solar tracker structure equipment, and transformers. Under precision products, the company manufactures smart ring components, engine parts, multi-layer PCBs, data center components, military grade connectors, high precision turbine blades, antennas, and electrical grounding clamps. Under capital goods, it manufactures LPG storage tanks, horton sphere, marine unloaders, CNG storage tanks, claus reactor, bullet train railway girders, machine components, finished industrial equipment, electro-mechanical assemblies, and products for robotics and automation. The company also manufactures electronics products, defense and aerospace components including parts for aerial vehicles, defense systems, aircraft, and rocket casings; and injection-molded components. Additionally, it offers prototyping and pre-production services, original design manufacturing for transformers, process plant machinery, and metal manufacturing and defense applications, job work on customer-supplied materials, and project engineering services. The company's Ecosystem Business segment sources and supplies industrial raw materials and commodities, including ferrous and non-ferrous metals, along with petrochemicals. It also provides manufacturing support services. It serves the transportation, industrial machinery and equipment, consumer products, electronics and appliances, construction and infrastructure, energy and utilities, and aerospace and defense industries. Zetwerk Manufacturing Businesses Limited was incorporated in 2017 and is based in Bengaluru, India.","employees":3554,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795529878},"ana